Print Substrings Starting with 'b

Given a string S, print all substrings that start with the character 'b'.

After printing all valid substrings, print the total count.

Input Format

A single string S

Constraints

1 <= S.length() <= 100 * String contains lowercase English letters only.

Output Format

Print all substrings starting with 'b'. * In the last line print:

`text Count = value

Sample Input 0

text
ball
Sample Output 0

Count = 0
Sample Input 1

text
robot
Sample Output 1

Count = 0
